* [ ] Map new content to the existing site architecture
* [ ] Keep homepage concise and conversion-focused
* [ ] Move relevant **Who Are We** content into About
* [ ] Move relevant **What We Do** content into Services
* [ ] Add **Our Work** content once projects/client details are supplied
* [ ] Update Contact messaging
* [ ] Decide whether **Join Us** is required for launch

