## Launch Principle

**Do not rebuild the finished website around the structure of the supplied document.**

Use the document as the new source of brand and marketing content, then integrate the strongest material into the existing architecture.

Structural changes should only be introduced where they materially improve the site — particularly around:

* Three ways to work with Default Social
* Team
* Work / client proof
* Join Us

Everything else should primarily be handled through **content editing and CMS updates rather than another redesign**.
